Package: MFD
Title: Multi-ancestry Fine-mapping Decision
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Guangxin", "Chen", , "chen4422@purdue.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adaptively selects between joint and post-hoc multi-ancestry
    fine-mapping strategies based on locus-level genetic architecture.
    Given GWAS summary statistics and LD matrices for two ancestry groups,
    MFD applies a three-step decision rule to choose between MESuSiE
    (joint modeling) and SuSiE post-hoc (per-ancestry modeling), and
    returns per-SNP posterior inclusion probabilities (PIPs) and credible sets.
